{"chef|A bump's gone missing!":{"file":"chef-01c7471c28.mp3","seconds":1.13,"env":"02129787421038988777211543320"},"chef|A check failed: the claim goes to a claims handler. A good agent knows when to hand over.":{"file":"chef-745c06ee1c.mp3","seconds":6.89,"env":"05314497231109988765310000000000000001612439988886289984213673032598778721237776434321000000000000000000035314998330489972366640100000046799999762224877732432377664767522310"},"chef|A document is missing: the agent drafts the request. It doesn't guess what it doesn't have.":{"file":"chef-593c02c63b.mp3","seconds":7.49,"env":"05521099510339999961100474279999611133110000000000000000000000000551015999425985111223799998110000354650225842100000000000000000001411119993797232299862111100000024897612159963663122586420"},"chef|Agents!":{"file":"chef-f505ffe132.mp3","seconds":1.01,"env":"03311110257996259865301100"},"chef|And here we are at the pass: every step is checked before serving. Tonight, no language model: deterministic code was enough. Knowing when not to use an LLM is part of the job too.":{"file":"chef-d887d9c32c.mp3","seconds":13.18,"env":""},"chef|And here we are at the pass. The model read, the code checked, then decided. The model never has the last word: that's what AI you can put into production looks like.":{"file":"chef-114cca59ab.mp3","seconds":12.79,"env":""},"chef|And that's service!":{"file":"chef-9c2d9d7431.mp3","seconds":1.37,"env":"04553145542011112979996368532000000"},"chef|And the pass is right here, in front of me. Nothing leaves this kitchen without my check. That's how I work with AI: the agents prepare, but every step is checked before it reaches you. Over to you!":{"file":"chef-970e7256c8.mp3","seconds":14.66,"env":""},"chef|Any of them can win!":{"file":"chef-4823991e82.mp3","seconds":1.2,"env":"068899896327674247665699765431"},"chef|Any orders?":{"file":"chef-5377d7a750.mp3","seconds":0.98,"env":"0589888641268885477852000"},"chef|Batch served!":{"file":"chef-761198c277.mp3","second